package views

// AboutPage tells the family story. Draft copy from confirmed facts. Edit freely.
templ AboutPage(l Layout) {
	@Base(l) {
		<section class="page">
			<h1>About us</h1>
			<p class="page-lede">
				We are a family-run workshop, a father and his two sons, with more than
				fifty years of combined experience between us.
			</p>
			<p>
				We have spent those years specialising in Hino trucks and Toyota Hilux
				bakkies, in particular the light-duty Hino 300 and the heavy-duty Hino
				700. It is what we know best.
			</p>
			<p>
				That focus is why fleets like Fidelity trust us to keep their vehicles
				moving. Being a small family business, we treat every customer the same
				way, honestly, personally, and with a straight answer about what your
				vehicle actually needs.
			</p>
			<p>
				When your truck or bakkie is off the road, your business is too. Getting
				you back to work quickly is the whole point of what we do.
			</p>
		</section>
	}
}
